{"id":"vod_md_6510","vodId":"6510","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"虫王战队超王者","name_cn":"虫王战队超王者","date":"2023-01-01","year":"2023","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"50集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20231104-1/b96c3d094720a25ebbc87715048745b3.jpg"},"summary":"这是史上第一个昆虫主题的超级战队！5位国王和昆虫机器人，描绘了前所未有的幻想大作。本作的重点是5位英雄全员都是国王！他们挺身对抗袭击地球人的“敌人・地帝国虫纳洛克” 。国王英雄们拿着作为王者证明的变身剑“王者圣剑” 和变形盾“君王武装”，乘坐名为“君王者”的机器人与敌人战斗。而守护着五名英雄并一同与敌人战斗的是“昆虫形机器人”。本作的机器人是昆虫型机械生命体“守护神”！ 它们是曾经保护过“地球”的守护神，国王们通过“王者圣剑” 与守护神维持沟通并借此长久守护着各自的国家。并且当“神瓢虫”、“神蜘蛛”、“神蚂蚁”与守护神们合体后，国王们乘坐的最强机器人“君王者”诞生！ 敬请期待这些强大又艳丽的昆虫机器人们！","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"剧情,动作,奇幻"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2024-05-06 03:23:54","episodeCount":51,"playable":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231103/yjc7k4xE/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231103/IZ1pqPFE/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231103/rusK6Qem/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231103/qPM2vDNu/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231103/MwMh6T5a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231103/JfsBQ9eM/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231103/dCcqmZdT/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231103/XDhDHQJL/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231103/bOf5pMcn/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231103/1W11oFsU/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231103/Pq347Vfu/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231103/qsF3OdUv/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231103/bPCnf96F/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231103/1x1rLXqa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231103/EYVRwArP/index.m3u